{"id":"838a6fb712f8a04f","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-query-degree-upper-bounds.md","title":"Decision Tree Bounds from Polynomial Degree","display":"thm-query-degree-upper-bounds — Decision Tree Bounds from Polynomial Degree","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-query-degree-upper-bounds","aliases":["28-thm-query-degree-upper-bounds"],"display":"thm-query-degree-upper-bounds — Decision Tree Bounds from Polynomial Degree","depends_on":["[[28-df-multilinear-degree]]","[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]","[[28-df-decision-tree]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 12.15; proof omitted in the textbook","source_printed_pages":"267","source_pdf_pages":"293","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"statement-checked-proof-not-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-query-degree-upper-bounds"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-query-degree-upper-bounds</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-query-degree-upper-bounds — Decision Tree Bounds from Polynomial Degree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fdddab942ae105d7\" href=\"?note=fdddab942ae105d7\" title=\"28-df-multilinear-degree\">28-df-multilinear-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa724d0d8b6348dc\" href=\"?note=aa724d0d8b6348dc\" title=\"28-df-block-sensitivity\">28-df-block-sensitivity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4526464ba7e934ba\" href=\"?note=4526464ba7e934ba\" title=\"28-df-decision-tree\">28-df-decision-tree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 12.15; proof omitted in the textbook"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"267"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"293"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked-proof-not-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 是全定义布尔函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d=\\deg(f)\">\\(d=\\deg(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fdddab942ae105d7\" href=\"?note=fdddab942ae105d7\" title=\"28-df-multilinear-degree\">28-df-multilinear-degree</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=bs(f)\">\\(b=bs(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"aa724d0d8b6348dc\" href=\"?note=aa724d0d8b6348dc\" title=\"28-df-block-sensitivity\">28-df-block-sensitivity</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\mathrm{DT}}\">\\(D_{\\mathrm{DT}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4526464ba7e934ba\" href=\"?note=4526464ba7e934ba\" title=\"28-df-decision-tree\">28-df-decision-tree</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b\\le2d^2,\\qquad D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)\\le d^2b\\le2d^4.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b\\le2d^2,\\qquad D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)\\le d^2b\\le2d^4.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书Theorem12.15第一式印为bs≤2 deg，但其Table12.1随后给D≤2deg^4，标准Nisan–Szegedy界为bs≤2deg²；这里采用平方修正，避免把错误线性界写入网络。第二式为教材陈述。未在本条重建深证明，故不作为已核验的证明依赖。 已目视PDF293确认不是文本上标提取丢失。平方界另核对 Nisan–Szegedy, On the degree of Boolean functions as real polynomials (1994), Lemma 3.8, 印刷310/PDF10：<a href=\"https://web.vu.lt/mif/s.jukna/boolean/Nisan-Szegedy.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原始论文</a>；该处deg(f)≥sqrt(bs(f)/2)与本条第一界等价。外部来源只用于原书纠错核对，不引入外部原子依赖。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 12.15; proof omitted in the textbook；印刷页 267；PDF 页 293。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第12章的 Decision Tree Bounds from Polynomial Degree，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n<p>外部证据边界：原始论文Lemma 3.8的陈述及其与平方界的代数等价已核对；未完整复核原始论文证明。本地PDF293图像与原始论文对应条目分开记录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-multilinear-degree","status":"resolved","id":"fdddab942ae105d7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-multilinear-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-block-sensitivity","status":"resolved","id":"aa724d0d8b6348dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-decision-tree","status":"resolved","id":"4526464ba7e934ba","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-decision-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-multilinear-degree","status":"resolved","id":"fdddab942ae105d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是全定义布尔函数；$d=\\deg(f)$ 见 [[28-df-multilinear-degree]]，$b=bs(f)$ 见 [[28-df-block-sensitivity]]，$D_{\\mathrm{DT}}$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-block-sensitivity","status":"resolved","id":"aa724d0d8b6348dc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是全定义布尔函数；$d=\\deg(f)$ 见 [[28-df-multilinear-degree]]，$b=bs(f)$ 见 [[28-df-block-sensitivity]]，$D_{\\mathrm{DT}}$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-decision-tree","status":"resolved","id":"4526464ba7e934ba","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是全定义布尔函数；$d=\\deg(f)$ 见 [[28-df-multilinear-degree]]，$b=bs(f)$ 见 [[28-df-block-sensitivity]]，$D_{\\mathrm{DT}}$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"d=\\deg(f)","display":false},{"tex":"b=bs(f)","display":false},{"tex":"D_{\\mathrm{DT}}","display":false},{"tex":"b\\le2d^2,\\qquad D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)\\le d^2b\\le2d^4.","display":true}],"bytes":2336,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-339","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-zero-error-query-complexity]]、[[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]、[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]、[[28-lem-sensitivity-query-bounds]]、[[28-thm-sensitivity-certificate-bound]]、[[28-df-multilinear-degree]]、[[28-lem-degree-query-lower-bound]]、[[28-thm-query-degree-upper-bounds]]。"}],"outgoing":["fdddab942ae105d7","aa724d0d8b6348dc","4526464ba7e934ba"]}